Package: tweetdelete
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), xdg-utils, systemd
Maintainer: TweetDelete <noreply@example.invalid>
Description: Bulk delete your posts, reposts, and likes on X
 A browser-based tool to bulk delete your own posts, replies, reposts, and
 likes on X (Twitter), filtered by date range. All logic runs as plain
 JavaScript in your browser; a small local systemd-managed helper server
 exists only to work around X's API not supporting CORS for direct browser
 requests, and to host the OAuth 2.0 callback page.
 .
 Depends on the system python3 (no bundled interpreter) since the server
 has no third-party dependencies - any Python 3.8+ runs it identically, and
 this way it always receives the same security patches as the rest of the
 system via apt.
